decision_conditions:
Condition : 3 - Prior commencement of development, the applicant shall submit to the Local Planning Authority, for approval in writing, details and samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted. The samples/details shall include: 
- Brick/stonework (including brick, stone, masonry, brick framing feature, mortar, metal grid lattice, colours, panels and patterns) manufacturer's details and photographic sample board where relevant; 
- Window types, sills, sections/reveals and all privacy measures (including obscure glazing details); 
- Roof covering, balustrading treatment and handrails and; 
Any other materials/details to be used (including rainwater goods and boiler flues). 
The development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with the approved details and maintained as such thereafter.
Reason: To safeguard the appearance of the area.
